## Area

authentication and password policy

## Describe the bug

Precomputed password denylists can be bypassed when Keycloak runs under a Turkish-like
default JVM locale.

## Version

main

## Expected behavior

Password normalization must use the same locale-independent mapping when building and
querying a denylist.

## Actual behavior

An authenticated realm user can choose a password that the realm administrator has
explicitly banned. The precomputed Bloom list lowercases entries with `Locale.ROOT`,
but validation uses the process locale. Under `tr-TR`, `I` normalizes to dotless `ı`
instead of indexed `i`, and validation returns no policy error.

## How to Reproduce?

The focused test creates the denylist through Keycloak's precomputed Bloom-list path,
wires the same policy configuration read used by the provider, and changes only the
default locale before validation. The critical method is:

```java
@Test
public void precomputedDenylistLookupIsBypassedInTurkishLocale() throws Exception {
    Locale originalLocale = Locale.getDefault();
    Path directory = Files.createTempDirectory(Path.of("target"), "denylist-locale-");
    try {
        Path input = directory.resolve("denylist.txt");
        Files.writeString(input, "I\n");
        Path bloom = input.resolveSibling("denylist.txt.bloom");
        DenylistPasswordPolicyProviderFactory.buildBloomFile(input, bloom,
                DenylistPasswordPolicyProviderFactory.DEFAULT_FALSE_POSITIVE_PROBABILITY);

        FileBasedPasswordDenylist denylist = new FileBasedPasswordDenylist(
                directory, bloom.getFileName().toString(),
                DenylistPasswordPolicyProviderFactory.DEFAULT_FALSE_POSITIVE_PROBABILITY, 0);
        PasswordPolicyProvider parser = proxy(PasswordPolicyProvider.class, (method, args) ->
                "parseConfig".equals(method) ? denylist : null);
        KeycloakSession session = proxy(KeycloakSession.class, (method, args) ->
                "getProvider".equals(method) ? parser : null);
        PasswordPolicy policy = PasswordPolicy.build()
                .put(DenylistPasswordPolicyProviderFactory.ID, bloom.getFileName().toString())
                .build(session);
        RealmModel realm = proxy(RealmModel.class, (method, args) ->
                "getPasswordPolicy".equals(method) ? policy : null);
        KeycloakContext context = proxy(KeycloakContext.class, (method, args) ->
                "getRealm".equals(method) ? realm : null);
        DenylistPasswordPolicyProvider provider = new DenylistPasswordPolicyProvider(context, null);

        Locale.setDefault(Locale.forLanguageTag("tr-TR"));
        Assert.assertNull(provider.validate("alice", "I"));
    } finally {
        Locale.setDefault(originalLocale);
    }
}
```

